                "added": [
                    "#Avoiding SIDS. SIDS, or sudden infant death syndrome, is a very mysterious condition which you will want to protect against. No one particularly understands what causes it and some question whether it exists at all, but there are a few practices which seem to be related to the deaths. Follow these simple rules and your baby should be fine:[[Image:Care for Your New Baby Step 18.jpg|center]]"
                ],
                "removed": [
