                    "#Don’t ever shake your baby. Do not, under any circumstances, shake your baby. This will easily cause serious brain damage, spinal damage, or even kill your baby. You should not even shake them as a part of play until they have developed the muscles necessary to support this.[[Image:Care for Your New Baby Step 3.jpg|center]]",
