                    "#Combat diaper rash. Diaper rash is a common skin irritation that results when the baby’s skin cannot get dry, is rubbed too hard by the diaper, or when your baby has other health problems. It is often a result of not being changed enough or wearing a diaper that is too small, though it is easy to get diaper rashes and you should not feel bad if your baby gets one.<ref>http://www.mayoclinic.com/health/diaper-rash/DS00069</ref>[[Image:Care for Your New Baby Step 12.jpg|center|300px]]",
